        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Snowflake motif (make 9)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 1: ch 6, sl st to join ring. Round 2: * ch 5, 2 tr in ring, ch 5, sl st into ring; rep 5 more times (6 arms). Round 3: work back along each arm adding side spurs and a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "picot-snow"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "picot"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " at the tip. Fasten off."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Assembly"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Thread cord through the top picot of each snowflake. Space them 20 cm apart along the cord. Knot cord ends to loop for hanging."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
